      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "先生が好きかどうか、まだ……"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410480,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "ハルカと一緒に行くんでしょう？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410490,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "それならなんでも楽しめるよ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410500,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ふ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410510,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ふええええ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410520,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "あ"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410530,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "ありがとうございます"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410540,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 4,
      "Text": "ありがとうございますありがとうございますありがとうございます……"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410550,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "先生、無事にお帰りになりましたか？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410560,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "うん"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410570,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "ハルカは？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410580,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "はい、今ちょうどお風呂上がりで横になっています"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410590,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "今日は"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410600,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "本当に"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410610,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "本当に本当に"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410620,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "楽しかったです"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410630,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "それで"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410640,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "もし今度、機会があれば"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410650,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "また……"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410660,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "もちろん"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410670,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "いつでも言ってね"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410680,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "……！"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410690,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "はい！"
    }
  ],
  "DialogKR": [
    {
      "Id": 101410010,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "선생님, 저, 한가지 상담 드릴 것이……."
