      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "So. Um. Well."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410030,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Is it really okay for someone like me to wear a dress...?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410040,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "Nevermindsorrypleaseforgetaboutit"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410050,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I just don't feel confident in one..."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101410060,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "Anyone can wear a dress! There's no requirements!"
